Also update the docstring with return_counts documentation. And empty-array counts: np.empty(0, np.intp). Original used np.bool for empty indices (arguably a bug); keep as is for index/inverse but add counts with np.intp.

Also check for object arrays: aux[1:] != aux[:-1] works. np.diff on idx works.

